#add ssh key to your github---------------connect git bash to your github account.
open github -> click your user Profile on your portal right upper -> click "setting" first icon on third block of menu bar. -> click "SSH and GPG keys" on fifth icon of second menu bar on your left hand. ->
click green icon "New SSH key" -> your title name (whatever decided by yourself) -> copy the content return from code "cat ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub". -> click "Add SSH key"
